      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019m LIVE on @MadDogRadio and I\u2019m getting RIGHT to it! A LOT went down this weekend and I\u2019ve got takes on ALL of it.\n\nHOLLA AT YOUR BOY! \n\n\ud83d\udce1: sxm.app.link/MadDogRadio",
