      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Unfiltered. Unapologetic. No dodging the truth. I am LIVE on @MadDogRadio from 1PM - 3PM ET. \n\nNFL Draft Round 1 is in the books! Call in with your best takes and your best takes ONLY! \n\n\ud83d\udce1 : sxm.app.link/SASonSXM",
