    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019m not apologizing for a damn thing @DanhausenAD. Not a damn thing. Curse or no curse, the @nyknicks have NO BUSINESS losing this series to the @ATLHawks \u2014 no matter how good that young team is. No business. If the @Knicks lose this series, heads need to roll. Period. President! GM! Coach! Players! Even the damn Dance Team! To hell with all that superstitious stuff. The @nyknicks need to handle their damn business. They had better not lose this series, damnit. I swear they better not!\n\n\nDanhaus",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2047703310778421530",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T15:44:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
